<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/cache"><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: apcu;"><label for="field-UID">APCu Enabled</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="apcu" type="checkbox" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">APCu Enabled</label></div></div></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: redis;"><label for="field-UID">Redis Enabled</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="redis" type="checkbox" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Redis Enabled</label></div></div></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: memcached;"><label for="field-UID">Memcached Enabled</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="memcached" type="checkbox" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Memcached Enabled</label></div></div></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: filesystem;"><label for="field-UID">Filesystem Enabled</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="filesystem" type="checkbox" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Filesystem Enabled</label></div></div></div><div class="form-field json-field " data-type="json" style="--grid-area: redisConfig;"><label for="field-UID">Redis Configuration</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="redisConfig" rows="8" placeholder="{&quot;host&quot;: &quot;127.0.0.1&quot;, &quot;port&quot;: 6379, &quot;timeout&quot;: 1, &quot;password&quot;: null, &quot;database&quot;: 0}" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID">{
    "host": "127.0.0.1",
    "port": 6379,
    "timeout": 1,
    "password": null,
    "database": 0
}</textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Redis cache backend configuration. Options: <code>host</code> (string), <code>port</code> (int), <code>timeout</code> (int), <code>password</code> (string|null), <code>database</code> (int).</p></div><div class="form-field json-field " data-type="json" style="--grid-area: memcachedConfig;"><label for="field-UID">Memcached Configuration</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="memcachedConfig" rows="8" placeholder="{&quot;host&quot;: &quot;127.0.0.1&quot;, &quot;port&quot;: 11211}" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID">{
    "host": "127.0.0.1",
    "port": 11211
}</textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Memcached cache backend configuration. Options: <code>host</code> (string), <code>port</code> (int).</p></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: domainScoped;"><label for="field-UID">Scope Cache by Domain</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="domainScoped" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Scope Cache by Domain</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">On by default. Turn this off only when several Total CMS installs share one <code>tcms-data</code> folder — it lets them share one cache namespace so a save in any install invalidates all of them. License, session, and password reset data always stay separate per domain.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>